{"ID":"20240708091349-vt5z4vf","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20240708091349-vt5z4vf","title":"0.作者的话","type":"doc","updated":"20240913220347"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240913220054-nhvpyr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913220054-nhvpyr4","updated":"20240913220347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"当归"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/当归-20240913220054-2mhqtg7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708091349-ynux0dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708091349-ynux0dd","updated":"20240913160816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"做这图鉴过程中，才切身体会到中医中药处境实属不易，摇摇欲坠又岌岌可危，当药味不能确保正确，也就不能再谈疗效了。据眼前所见，中药材市场已是满目疮痍，甚而至于有些看不到希望。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913160747-pb63v7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913160747-pb63v7k","updated":"20240913160747"}},{"ID":"20240913144054-4c6wbmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913144054-4c6wbmf","updated":"20240913161000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"旧时郎中不仅要有行医施药的经验，更要有能辨别本草的眼力，行医采药本领于一身，才能药到病除。现如今诸多院校老师教学仅凭一张药材图片高谈阔论，讲解药性，难免贫瘠，确实不如西医院各类3D图形，精密仪器来的赏心悦目。由此个人只能尽绵薄之力，整理出这篇图鉴，奈何资历尚浅，分辨能力有限，也不敢称权威之作，只当是闭门造车，必有不当之处，如有疏错疑漏，烦请指正，本人实不愿此图鉴成为误人子弟之作。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913160747-sudkmh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913160747-sudkmh9","updated":"20240913160747"}},{"ID":"20240727120312-ih3ubs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727120312-ih3ubs2","updated":"20240913154604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"网络上错误谣传太多，虽已竭尽全力矫正，难免偏颇，该图鉴仅供各位参考解惑，增长见识，更多的也为各位平添一个方便。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240913160748-rl00bga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913160748-rl00bga","updated":"20240913160748"}},{"ID":"20240913154612-u3u9t3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240913154612-u3u9t3p","updated":"20240913161146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px;"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"个人能力终究有限，该笔记只当是燃起星星之火，希望更多有志之士弘扬中医，为振兴中医事业贡献自己的一份力量。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240806172911-bzvwcm5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240806172911-bzvwcm5"}}]}